  message: "Real-repro validation 2026-07-18 (the Apr12 cohort named in the repro): funnels wide open across ALL THREE languages on the real repos — Scala 242 misbinds (docspell), Swift 302 (VernissageServer), D 107 (dub). WI-bihit/WI-votar/WI-situj built only a narrow receiver-type slice (annotated-vals+ctor-params / function-params / typed-params); the dominant patterns (case-class .copy(), Vapor route builders, free-function-form, calls on locals/loop-vars/fields) still bare-lookup-misbind @0.85. All 3 reopened todo_hard. CLOSURE-EVIDENCE LESSON: WI-bihit/WI-votar were closed done on \"0 misbinds, funnels closed end-to-end\" via unit tests + the zero-baseline SwiftyJSON cohort, NOT the real repro corpus — an open-ended behavioral invariant treated as closed without its own filed repro. Validation harness + surveys in scratchpad. Design approach: owner chose 3-lens investigation first."  # 7a46
